{"id":"st-en-cafe","lang":"en","level":"초급","cat":"일상","title":{"ko":"카페에서 친구 기다리기","en":"Meeting a friend at a café"},"lines":[
 {"t":"Hey! Sorry I'm [running late].","ko":"안녕! 늦어서 미안해.","en":"Hi! Sorry I'm late.","m":{"ko":"늦어지고 있는","en":"behind schedule"}},
 {"t":"The bus was [super slow] today.","ko":"오늘 버스가 엄청 느렸어.","en":"The bus was very slow today.","m":{"ko":"엄청 느린","en":"very slow"}},
 {"t":"Did you already [order]?","ko":"벌써 주문했어?","en":"Have you ordered yet?","m":{"ko":"주문하다","en":"to ask for food or drinks"}},
 {"t":"Let's [grab] something quick.","ko":"간단하게 뭐 좀 먹자.","en":"Let's get something fast to eat.","m":{"ko":"(음식을) 간단히 먹다·사다","en":"to get quickly"}}]},
{"id":"st-en-meeting","lang":"en","level":"중급","cat":"회사","tab":"일·업무","title":{"ko":"회의 끝나고","en":"After the meeting"},"lines":[
 {"t":"That meeting went on [forever].","ko":"그 회의 진짜 끝도 없이 길었어.","en":"That meeting was really long.","m":{"ko":"엄청 오래","en":"for a very long time"}},
 {"t":"But I think we're finally [on the same page].","ko":"그래도 이제야 다들 같은 생각인 것 같아.","en":"But I think we finally agree.","m":{"ko":"같은 생각인","en":"in agreement"}},
 {"t":"Can you [send over] the slides later?","ko":"나중에 슬라이드 좀 보내 줄래?","en":"Can you send me the slides later?","m":{"ko":"(자료를) 보내 주다","en":"to send to someone"}},
 {"t":"Sure, I'll [get to it] after lunch.","ko":"응, 점심 먹고 바로 할게.","en":"Sure, I'll do it after lunch.","m":{"ko":"(일을) 시작하다, 처리하다","en":"to start doing it"}}]},
{"id":"st-en-offer","lang":"en","level":"고급","cat":"감정","title":{"ko":"이직 제안을 받고","en":"Thinking about a job offer"},"lines":[
 {"t":"I've been [going back and forth] about the new offer.","ko":"새 제안을 두고 계속 오락가락 고민 중이야.","en":"I keep changing my mind about the new offer.","m":{"ko":"결정을 못 하고 오락가락하다","en":"to keep changing one's mind"}},
 {"t":"The pay is better, but I'd be [starting from scratch].","ko":"월급은 더 좋은데, 처음부터 다시 시작해야 해.","en":"The pay is better, but I'd have to start over.","m":{"ko":"맨 처음부터","en":"from the very beginning"}},
 {"t":"Honestly, I don't want to [burn any bridges] here.","ko":"솔직히 여기 사람들이랑 관계를 망치고 싶지 않아.","en":"Honestly, I don't want to ruin my relationships here.","m":{"ko":"관계를 완전히 끊다","en":"to destroy a relationship for good"}},
 {"t":"Maybe I should [sleep on it] before I decide.","ko":"결정하기 전에 하룻밤 더 생각해 봐야겠어.","en":"Maybe I should think about it overnight first.","m":{"ko":"하룻밤 자며 생각해 보다","en":"to think about it overnight"}}]},
{"id":"st-ko-weekend","lang":"ko","level":"초급","cat":"일상","title":{"ko":"주말 약속 잡기","en":"Making weekend plans"},"lines":[
