 {"t":"[몇 분]이세요? 네 명이요.","en":"How many people? Four.","m":{"en":"how many people (honorific)"}},
 {"t":"창가 자리로 [부탁드려요].","en":"A window seat, please.","m":{"en":"please (polite request)"}},
